name: evening-digest
description: "Daily 9PM digest — tasks completed, messages, unresolved items, memory log entry"
cron: "0 21 * * *"
timezone: "America/New_York"
steps:
  - tool: sessions_send
    label: compose-digest
    input:
      agentId: legacy
      message: |
        EVENING DIGEST — compile and DM Zeus (1024395579742228570) via Discord DM.

        Build this digest:
        =============================
        EVENING DIGEST — {today}

        COMPLETED TODAY: Check Todoist API (TODOIST_API_KEY env var) for tasks
        completed today. List up to 10.

        MESSAGES: Summarize notable messages received today across all channels
        (Discord, Telegram, iMessage). Count total, highlight any requiring follow-up.

        UNRESOLVED: List any open items that need attention tomorrow —
        unanswered questions, failed health checks, pending approvals.

        MEMORY LOG: Write a 2-3 sentence summary of today to the daily memory
        file at memory/{today}.md. Include key accomplishments and tomorrow's
        top priority.
        =============================
        Keep total message under 300 words. Reflective but concise tone.
